{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1035266-cofd-aliens-homebrew","id":1035266,"title":"CofD Aliens Homebrew","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-20T09:17:51-08:00","id":1035266,"title":"CofD Aliens Homebrew","content":"So, I've been toying with the idea lately of designing homebrew playable splats for extraterrestrials in the Chronicles of Darkness. I've got some good ideas, but I'm hung up on something and I need some opinions. Should I create playable splats from the point-of-view of the aliens themselves, or should I make it from the point-of-view of human/alien hybrids?<br /> <br /> The challenge with telling stories from the point-of-view of aliens is even though it's a unique and fresh perspective, players may find it difficult to relate to inhuman alien characters. It would be difficult to balance the more sympathetic, human-like aspects of aliens while maintaining a sense surreal, inhuman dread. Plus I'm having some difficulty dividing up the aliens into five factions that make sense for a Chronicles of Darkness game. <br /> <br /> The challenge for hybrids is that even though they would fit in with the Chronicles of Darkness theme of transformed-humans-as-characters, I feel like it's already been done to death. A hybrid story would have a similar feel to Changelings (well, more like if Changeling, Demon, and the upcoming Deviant all have a mutant love child). The Aliens would effectively be the enemy (similar to the Fae or the God-Machine) and they would be tracking down rogue Hybrids who must remain hidden while trying to disrupt the plans of the alien overlords. <br /> <br /> So what do you guys think? I know there is not much to go on, but I'm hesitant to reveal what I already have designed until I'm sure of the direction I want to go in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob","name":"Nuwisha Nutjob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T09:22:27-08:00","id":1035267,"title":"","content":"The primary reason to have transformed humans is pretty simple: to give the characters a niche and attachments that aren't about being an alien.<br /> <br /> <br /> It is of course done to death.<br /> <br /> <br /> In any event, one consideration you need to establish is the importance or significance of technology, if for no other reason than to establish their power progression or if the way you progress your aliens is through biology.<br /> <br /> I chose the later in Monarch because technology was so hard to write a power system for, but the problem with choosing biology is that it narrows the choice of alien species and forces you to make everyone the same species. I got around this by making mine all about a specific race of swarming biohorrors with variable forms and constant evolution like a mix of Zerg Tyranids, and the Flood.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":7015,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","user":"Almarck","date":". 01-20-2017, 12:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T10:04:41-08:00","id":1035292,"title":"","content":"There is definitely going to be a technology and psychic focus. Some traits might be affected by biology, but for the most part the focus will be advanced science and parapsychology. I have thought of a way to make the aliens just supernatural enough to compete with the other denizens of the CofD. Also, I have some ideas for antagonists that are more biological than technical.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob","name":"Nuwisha Nutjob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T10:25:53-08:00","id":1035303,"title":"","content":"Are you talking a large, unified Gameline, or a smaller one-off (or few-off) splat, like minor/micro templates? Larger Gamelines carry their own baggage in regards to developing enough material for self-contained games. Minor Templates are both mechanically less intensive, and can be dropped in the existing CofD with only their inherent background or explicitly mentioned links.<br /> <br /> Are you going for grand themes and moods, or more limited strangeness?<br /> <br /> (I do wish they kept the Alien Origins they initially alluded to for the Visitors in Immortals)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T11:13:20-08:00","id":1035323,"title":"","content":"<b>Re: Aliens</b><br /> <br /> I have toyed around with these ideas myself -<br /> <br /> I can think of two different approaches.<br /> <br /> If you are going with a very defined setting with a set group of races, each race would be the equivalent of the &quot;Inborn&quot; part of the template (like Auspice, Clan, etc). The &quot;Faction&quot; portion of the template would be used to flesh out the various parties that make up your setting.<br /> <br /> The other idea is to use a setup similar to Changeling the Lost 2nd edition.<br /> <br /> The Seeming Equivalent would be used for the alien base culture (logical philosophers, honorable warriors, pragmatic capitalists, open minded explorers, etc)<br /> <br /> The Kith Equivalent would offer a very open set of options and abilites (you could probably just re-flavor them to be more sci fi and less fantasy)<br /> <br /> this option would be good for a Mos Eisley style variety of species.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420009-the-artificer-s-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">The Artificer's Workshop</a> - A collection of Exalted Artifacts<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806809-curios-relics-and-tomes\" target=\"_blank\">Curios, Relics, and Tomes</a> - A collection of Relics (Cursed and Otherwise)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show\" target=\"_blank\">The Horror Lab</a> - A collection of Beasts, Monsters and less definable things.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1128197-strange-places#post1128197\" target=\"_blank\">Strange Places</a> - A collection of Dark, Mysterious, and Wondrous Locations<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993181-twilight-menagerie\" target=\"_blank\">Twilight Menagerie</a> - A collection of Ephemeral Entities","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell","name":"Reighnhell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"749"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T11:37:47-08:00","id":1035337,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Reighnhell</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1035266-cofd-aliens-homebrew?p=1035323#post1035323\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Re: Aliens</b><br /> <br /> I have toyed around with these ideas myself -<br /> <br /> I can think of two different approaches.<br /> <br /> If you are going with a very defined setting with a set group of races, each race would be the equivalent of the &quot;Inborn&quot; part of the template (like Auspice, Clan, etc). The &quot;Faction&quot; portion of the template would be used to flesh out the various parties that make up your setting.<br /> <br /> The other idea is to use a setup similar to Changeling the Lost 2nd edition.<br /> <br /> The Seeming Equivalent would be used for the alien base culture (logical philosophers, honorable warriors, pragmatic capitalists, open minded explorers, etc)<br /> <br /> The Kith Equivalent would offer a very open set of options and abilites (you could probably just re-flavor them to be more sci fi and less fantasy)<br /> <br /> this option would be good for a Mos Eisley style variety of species.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Court&quot; (or the social splat) would then correspond to various inter-alien organizations they may be a part of, then?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T11:45:24-08:00","id":1035345,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1035266-cofd-aliens-homebrew?p=1035303#post1035303\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are you talking a large, unified Gameline, or a smaller one-off (or few-off) splat, like minor/micro templates? Larger Gamelines carry their own baggage in regards to developing enough material for self-contained games. Minor Templates are both mechanically less intensive, and can be dropped in the existing CofD with only their inherent background or explicitly mentioned links.<br /> <br /> Are you going for grand themes and moods, or more limited strangeness?</div> </div> </div> </div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Ideally, I would like it to be a gameline similar to Dragon: the Embers or Genius: the Transgression. It's a bit of an ambitious project for me to tackle alone, but I'm just gonna take baby-steps and work on it as I can. Keep it simple and expand on the details as I go. I see Hybrids as being a Minor Template to Aliens, just as Wolf-Blooded are to Uratha. But I've got some ideas that would make the Aliens a much larger template. I have some rough concepts (no real stats yet) for powers, technology, power-stat, integrity-stat, factions, background, and antagonists. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I need to ponder on themes for a bit, but I've got a couple of rough ones:</span></span><ul><li>Strangers in a Strange Land - Aliens are like foreign spies infiltrating another country. They may have been briefed on what Earth is like, but there is a difference between learning and experiencing. Sometimes, that difference can get an Alien killed, or worse.</li> <li>The Human Question - There is no question that Earth is a potential resource, but what about Humanity? Humans are both a threat and convenient resource, and yet time and time again aliens and humans manage to make meaningful connections. Should Aliens attempt to reach out to humanity, or should they remain hidden? Should they court humanity as allies, or should they use them as cattle?</li> </ul><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I need to consider what the overall mood of the game is, so I'll have to get back to you on that one.</span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob","name":"Nuwisha Nutjob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T12:01:58-08:00","id":1035354,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Reighnhell</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1035266-cofd-aliens-homebrew?p=1035323#post1035323\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Re: Aliens</b><br /> <br /> I have toyed around with these ideas myself -<br /> <br /> I can think of two different approaches.<br /> <br /> If you are going with a very defined setting with a set group of races, each race would be the equivalent of the &quot;Inborn&quot; part of the template (like Auspice, Clan, etc). The &quot;Faction&quot; portion of the template would be used to flesh out the various parties that make up your setting.<br /> <br /> The other idea is to use a setup similar to Changeling the Lost 2nd edition.<br /> <br /> The Seeming Equivalent would be used for the alien base culture (logical philosophers, honorable warriors, pragmatic capitalists, open minded explorers, etc)<br /> <br /> The Kith Equivalent would offer a very open set of options and abilites (you could probably just re-flavor them to be more sci fi and less fantasy)<br /> <br /> this option would be good for a Mos Eisley style variety of species.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I like the Seeming equivalent idea, making it a sort of Alien caste or class that prioritizes how they function in Alien society. The Kith would be their Xenoform, their biological appearance and advantages. For example, something like a Grey (Xenoform) Scientist (Caste). I think there should be some free-form design when it comes to the Xenoform, since Ufology is full of encounters with a menagerie of otherworldly visitors. My ideas for factions centered around what Aliens wanted to do with the Earth. Do they want to manipulate it from the shadows (The Secret Government) or do they want to appear as Humanity's saviors and friends? Do they want to conquer humanity and be worshiped as deities, or do they want to remain isolated from humanity, harvesting them for parts and interacting with it only when necessary? <br /> <br /> The Factions need a little work, but there is potential.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob","name":"Nuwisha Nutjob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T12:11:01-08:00","id":1035361,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar5700_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5700\" data-vbnamecard=\"5700\">Nuwisha Nutjob</a> Have you looked through Alien: The Stranded (and Alien: The Conspiracy, and Visitor: the Harvest)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T12:12:38-08:00","id":1035366,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1035266-cofd-aliens-homebrew?p=1035361#post1035361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar5700_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5700\" data-vbnamecard=\"5700\">Nuwisha Nutjob</a> Have you looked through Alien: The Stranded (and Alien: The Conspiracy, and Visitor: the Harvest)?</div> </div> </div> </div>No I have not. Do you have any links?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob","name":"Nuwisha Nutjob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T12:24:51-08:00","id":1035376,"title":"","content":"Wow, so I was completely unaware that others had attempted to make homebrews about Aliens. I probably should have done a little more research. I just looked up a link for Alien: the Stranded and found a document. It's first theme is word for word Stranger in a Strange Land. <br /> <br /> So before I accidentally commit plagiarism and get accused of ripping off other people's work, I'm going to stop here and read these homebrews before I respond further. To the creators of the homebrews I meant no disrespect and it is pure coincidence on my part.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob","name":"Nuwisha Nutjob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T13:01:52-08:00","id":1035393,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nuwisha Nutjob</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1035266-cofd-aliens-homebrew?p=1035376#post1035376\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wow, so I was completely unaware that others had attempted to make homebrews about Aliens. I probably should have done a little more research. I just looked up a link for Alien: the Stranded and found a document. It's first theme is word for word Stranger in a Strange Land.<br /> <br /> So before I accidentally commit plagiarism and get accused of ripping off other people's work, I'm going to stop here and read these homebrews before I respond further. To the creators of the homebrews I meant no disrespect and it is pure coincidence on my part.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It's no problem. Look it's just that when people do alien splats, they generally go for the same things and draw from the same UFO-ology lore. This is why Greys and Reptoid aliens are figured into their assessment and why most of them are very tech heavy. I mean, XCOM draws on the same archetypes for instance.<br /> <br /> It's rare that people go out of their way to do something different.<br /> <br /> <br /> Also, if you're gonna be researching what's already been done using aliens... Well, I wrote this, about playing a very specific type of alien. Maybe it'll give you some ideas.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\"> Monarch: the Endless - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Monarch: The Endless A Roleplaying game about being the inhuman ruler of an alien hive, whether or not you want to. The professor fiddled with his presentation, </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":7015,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","user":"Almarck","date":". 01-20-2017, 04:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T14:04:51-08:00","id":1035438,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Almarck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1035266-cofd-aliens-homebrew?p=1035393#post1035393\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's no problem. Look it's just that when people do alien splats, they generally go for the same things and draw from the same UFO-ology lore. This is why Greys and Reptoid aliens are figured into their assessment and why most of them are very tech heavy. I mean, XCOM draws on the same archetypes for instance.<br /> <br /> It's rare that people go out of their way to do something different.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep. A lot of people converging upon the same points.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Almarck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1035266-cofd-aliens-homebrew?p=1035393#post1035393\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, if you're gonna be researching what's already been done using aliens... Well, I wrote this, about playing a very specific type of alien. Maybe it'll give you some ideas.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\"> Monarch: the Endless - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Monarch: The Endless A Roleplaying game about being the inhuman ruler of an alien hive, whether or not you want to. The professor fiddled with his presentation, </div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>We really need to progress that more. It has some good ideas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T14:30:59-08:00","id":1035449,"title":"","content":"Sooo after taking a look around, it seems most of my ideas have already been expressed in one homebrew gameline or another. I'm unfortunately gonna have to scrap my idea. I can still incorporate my ideas into one of the other homebrews, but it's best I don't try build my own in lieu of what others have already written.<br /> <br /> I do have to say though the other gamelines look pretty cool. I almost feel like the authors should get together and create a super-alien game. That would be pretty epic. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob","name":"Nuwisha Nutjob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T15:05:47-08:00","id":1035477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nuwisha Nutjob</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1035266-cofd-aliens-homebrew?p=1035449#post1035449\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sooo after taking a look around, it seems most of my ideas have already been expressed in one homebrew gameline or another. I'm unfortunately gonna have to scrap my idea. I can still incorporate my ideas into one of the other homebrews, but it's best I don't try build my own in lieu of what others have already written.<br /> <br /> I do have to say though the other gamelines look pretty cool. I almost feel like the authors should get together and create a super-alien game. That would be pretty epic. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It is one of the things that pops up often.<br /> <br /> Dragons and aliens make for surprisingly good fansplats.<br /> <br /> It is such a shame that you of course will be unable to persue your original project, but perhaps it is a blessing in disguise. <br /> <br /> Consider that maybe instead of focusing on a major template or having to cover every variant, you focus on making a minor template that's very accessible or that you focus on a very specific type of alien.<br /> <br /> I did the later, because I sincerely doubted that anyone else was thinking of making Zerginids: the Floodening.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-21T06:30:59-08:00","id":1035695,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Almarck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1035266-cofd-aliens-homebrew?p=1035267#post1035267\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The primary reason to have transformed humans is pretty simple: to give the characters a niche and attachments that aren't about being an alien.<br /> <br /> <br /> It is of course done to death.<br /> <br /> <br /> In any event, one consideration you need to establish is the importance or significance of technology, if for no other reason than to establish their power progression or if the way you progress your aliens is through biology.<br /> <br /> I chose the later in Monarch because technology was so hard to write a power system for, but the problem with choosing biology is that it narrows the choice of alien species and forces you to make everyone the same species. I got around this by making mine all about a specific race of swarming biohorrors with variable forms and constant evolution like a mix of Zerg Tyranids, and the Flood.</div> </div> </div> </div>How's this for a power station for technology, Portable Reactor, it's both power stat and a device that powers your alien technology. You raise your power stat when you build extra capacity into your Portable Reactor, making the technology more advanced. <br /> <br /> The Portable Reactor might normally be phase shifted with it's own mobility so it stays at your side hidden from sight powering your technology, till you give it a command to appear in normal 3d space for some reason. All your alien tech is keyed to you DNA or equivilant for your species.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-21T10:21:03-08:00","id":1035741,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1035266-cofd-aliens-homebrew?p=1035695#post1035695\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> How's this for a power station for technology, Portable Reactor, it's both power stat and a device that powers your alien technology. You raise your power stat when you build extra capacity into your Portable Reactor, making the technology more advanced.<br /> <br /> The Portable Reactor might normally be phase shifted with it's own mobility so it stays at your side hidden from sight powering your technology, till you give it a command to appear in normal 3d space for some reason. All your alien tech is keyed to you DNA or equivilant for your species.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> See I thought of that, though I was leaning more along the lines of bioaugmentation.<br /> <br /> I actually did try to build a more conventional Aliens Splat like the others did with Greys and Reptoids and Fish people.<br /> <br /> It was going to use a sort of Bio-Tech-Psi trifecta of powers in the same vein as Mass Effect did where there were six classes. 3 Pure classes, 3 hybrid classes and it was all going to run off an internalized power source like some sort of Deus Ex nanomachines or something like that.<br /> <br /> This was largely to ensure that it was something inherent to the person and keep it from ever being stolen, given away, or whatever, because a solid reactor, even if it could be phase shifted can be torn out.. Nanomachines couldn't.<br /> <br /> <br /> One alternative way of handling power was using instead actual physical batteries, energy cells, but alot of them and you had to burn through them constantly like you would ammo to do basically anything. Have solar collectors, power production, not always on your person and all that.<br /> <br /> Power stat here wasn't going to raise your power production or storage.<br /> <br /> Main reason I dropped these was because it was too... techy at the time. Though I guess using Psi Crystals as a power cell replacement would have made it... appreciable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-22T06:50:05-08:00","id":1036039,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nuwisha Nutjob</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1035266-cofd-aliens-homebrew?p=1035449#post1035449\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sooo after taking a look around, it seems most of my ideas have already been expressed in one homebrew gameline or another. I'm unfortunately gonna have to scrap my idea. I can still incorporate my ideas into one of the other homebrews, but it's best I don't try build my own in lieu of what others have already written.<br /> <br /> I do have to say though the other gamelines look pretty cool. I almost feel like the authors should get together and create a super-alien game. That would be pretty epic. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>As the guy who wrote Stranded I'd be up for some collaboration. But I'm only weeks away from defending my dissertation proposal and it's conference paper season. So if we could aim at something in May that would be cool.<br /> <br /> I do have to say, one reason aliens all look the same is because CoD takes a humanist approach to storytelling. If I'd written an Alien game for oWoD it'd look totally different (it'd be more straight up Excel Saga). As it is Stranded tries to be a game that's about losing yourself as much as it's about finding yourself.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also now that Anne Rice has added aliens to her setting I don't see any reason why CoD wouldn't go there. And no Changeling isn't a game that can subbed in for aliens.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1630,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1630-jacob","user":"Jacob","date":". 01-22-2017, 09:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1630-jacob","name":"Jacob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1630_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"681"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-25T20:12:12-08:00","id":1038227,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jacob</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1035266-cofd-aliens-homebrew?p=1036039#post1036039\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As the guy who wrote Stranded I'd be up for some collaboration. But I'm only weeks away from defending my dissertation proposal and it's conference paper season. So if we could aim at something in May that would be cool.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's definitely something I'd consider assuming I'm not busy in May.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob","name":"Nuwisha Nutjob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T12:18:02-07:00","id":1087280,"title":"","content":"It's May so I thought I'd give this a bump to see if folks still wanted to do some collaborationey thing around this topic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1630-jacob","name":"Jacob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1630_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"681"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T12:36:56-07:00","id":1087286,"title":"","content":"I may be able to help with writing specific things for such project or help at working on ideals, but unfortunately I won't be able to act as &quot;core member&quot;. But at any case, I would be watching any Alien project with anticipation!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-05T12:10:17-07:00","id":1088407,"title":"","content":"LostLight, if you have the time and patience to read through <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bqenEJzcTh7ZqNjnTByNUAIlq4BeomHLWrI1wJ8vtc4/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">this rough manuscript</a> and leave remarks everywhere the text doesn't really work, that would be helpful. I have ~20k words left on some fanfiction I'm writing and then I'll be revising the linked document (with an eye to completing revisions by the end of July).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1630-jacob","name":"Jacob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1630_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"681"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}